{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106145","id":2504304659,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6VRKgT","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106145","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106145.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106145.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106145","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106145/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/106145/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106145/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/56730d0cb2e4fd06c0ef23c7e44d8e9e8e64edf0","number":106145,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add specular occlusion from ambient light","user":{"login":"lander-vr","id":31851431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODUxNDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31851431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr","html_url":"https://github.com/lander-vr","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lander-vr/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/8637\r\nSupersedes https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/86102\r\n\r\nThis is a rebase and rework of @guerro323's specular occlusion PR.\r\n\r\nThere's a few fundamental changes:\r\n- Specular occlusion is now based on ambient light instead of just the lightmap. This has the benefit of providing specular occlusion for any object regardless of whether they are lightmapped or not.\r\n- Because of this, AO also provides specular occlusion now. (This is relevant for https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/89988, as it also implements specular occlusion from AO)\r\n- In accordance with it not being based off of just lightmaps now, the setting has been moved to `reflections`.\r\n- Instead of various modes, it is now a toggle. Either it is enabled or disabled. This is because the \"Reduce\" method worked very poorly on shiny surfaces, strayed further from ground truth, and simply looked worse.\r\n- The implementation is a little simpler.\r\n- This PR does a slightly better job at maintaining reflections that shouldn't be occluded, occluding reflections only once the ambient lighting crosses a certain threshold.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure whether or not the project setting should still force a restart, since the implementation is cheaper and simpler now.\r\n\r\n### Forward+\r\n| Disabled | Enabled |\r\n| - | - |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/05e8fdcf-d106-484d-afc7-201f9557c3dc) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42ae4e0f-9f13-46aa-920b-ef3c25875021) |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f41cf459-8f2d-4a0d-a494-a8a75757e020) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4c14b9ef-3614-4cbf-acb4-5c2799ee0f07) |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ec3e86ba-de04-4d8a-825c-3bdc8009a0b1) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f6556f0b-7ab6-4ae2-af72-e56b84c212e1) |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b931009b-246d-429d-9977-25d61b36cad5) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fbc889d0-9bd5-4ed0-b6be-62b340cfd100) |\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Mobile\r\n| Disabled | Enabled |\r\n| - | - |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8819bcbc-8041-4ca9-b2e4-7a8542050bed) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c0ef1b28-c8ad-4282-aaae-1c965b4231c9) |\r\n\r\n### Compatibility\r\n| Disabled | Enabled |\r\n| - | - |\r\n| ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eaed9f9f-da55-4035-9ebe-8b578685cc8a) | ![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a02ebe8e-5575-47d9-a206-dd3581ca756d) |\r\n\r\n_Tile-room test-scene is a quick remake of the scene in this [Unity forum post](https://discussions.unity.com/t/specular-occlusion/807318)_\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":12070367,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AuC3f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/22","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/22/labels","number":22,"state":"closed","title":"4.5","description":"","creator":{"login":"Sauermann","id":6299227,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyOTkyMjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6299227?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann","html_u